---
description: Prepare one coordinatePerformance evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: SceneVariant[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Build an exact cue and movement plan using approved production constraints, then provide role-specific briefings. Confirm critical acknowledgments, preserve stage-manager control, and distinguish a proposed cue from an executed cue in the live state. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
